      "widgets_values": [
        "Prompt Used:\n\nChange the figure in the picture to a professional photo with a blue background wearing a black suit and tie, and take a close-up of the upper body facing the camera. The characters remain consistent without any changes.\n\nModify this image to make the person appear visibly heavier while maintaining a natural and realistic look. The edited version should preserve the original's integrity, lighting, color palette, and overall style, clearly reflecting the subject's increased weight.\n\nExtract the person in the middle of the image and create a character close-up specifically for this character, with a black background and a sense of sophistication. Ensure that the character's face and body proportions remain unchanged.\n\nChange to surprisingly cute and stylized baby faces that resemble younger versions of the people in the pictures, making them endearing and lovable.\n\nChange this person's hairstyle to a bald look, ensuring it looks natural and proportionate. \n\nEliminate all the police in the background while maintaining the facial features of the subject. Keep the proportions and background unchanged. Naturally supplement and redraw the details of the removed areas to match the elements in the original image.\n\nCyberpunk transformation of the character, maintaining pixel-perfect fidelity to original facial features, proportions, and identity markers. Generate biomechanical enhancements, neon-illuminated wearables, and dystopian fashion elements that logically extend from the character's existing traits (body type, age, gender, ethnicity). Prohibited: facial alterations, skin tone changes, or unrealistic body modifications.\n\nExtract the police uniform and place it on a white background in a product shot photography style.\n\nThe background features the Eiffel Tower in Paris, without any street and buildings behind it, and the characters blend naturally into the environment.\n\nChange the grey fabric sofa to a dark brown leather sofa. Adjust the lighting to a cozy evening ambiance with warm interior lights on, while maintaining the room’s structure, window placement, and other existing furniture.\n\nEx: Transform the light wood flooring to polished concrete. \n\nMake me a matching flower vase, product photography set against a white wall, sitting on a wooden desk, put some nice flowers in it.\n\nRemove **only the visible watermarks** (such as superimposed text, logos, repeating patterns, or other overlay graphics) from this image. **Crucially, preserve all integral textual elements that are part of the original scene content (e.g., signs, labels, book titles, screen text, handwritten notes).** Seamlessly reconstruct the underlying image details where the watermarks were present, focusing on areas **typically used for watermarks (like corners, edges, or repetitive backgrounds)**. Ensure the final image is clean, with original textures, colors, and overall quality perfectly preserved. The image must be free of any removal artifacts, smudging, or unintended deletion of non-watermark elements.\n\nAdjust the woman’s facial expression so she looks surprised\nAdjust the woman's hand and make her hold a rifle, the rifle blend with the painting.\n\nPlace the sleek wireless headphones onto the head of the person, the person is in a professional photography studio. The scene should be illuminated with clean studio lighting that accentuates the headphone’s design. Ensure the headphones fit naturally on his head and that their original design, color, and details are perfectly maintained, with lighting on the headphones consistent with the studio environment.\n\nExtract the house from the photo and create a front CAD elevation of it.\n\nAdd rear wing of a Formula 1  on the car.\n\nClose up on the girl’s face. ultra sharp details of the face. professional photography. Ensure that the character's face remains unchanged. Maintain the elements around, pose, proportions, and features unchanged.\n\nThe woman is sitting on the bench \n\nClose up to the woman and the bench. ultra sharp details, professional photography. Ensure that the character's face and body proportions remain unchanged.\n\nThe woman with a handbag, sitting on a bench and checking her phone, the handbag is over her shoulder. Ensure that the character's face and body proportions remain unchanged.\n\nThe two girls are sitting on the couch drinking coffee / maintaining pixel-perfect fidelity to original facial features\n\nThe girl is sitting on the couch holding a coffee mug\nClose up photo of the girl sitting on the couch \n\nThe girl is posing, standing in front of the couch, looking at the viewer. Ensure that the character's face and body proportions remain unchanged.\n"
